<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility JME H1 profit dips.</title>
<headline>Czech utility JME H1 profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period ending June  30, 1997:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		354.676   vs   406.426</p>
<p> after-tax profit	    353.502   vs   406.426</p>
<p> operating profit	    379.508   vs   428.317</p>
<p> depreciation		  273.727   vs   232.338</p>
<p>sales of own</p>
<p> goods and services	6,128.771	5,926.887</p>
<p> other sales		     1.166	    0.008</p>
<p> basic capital	     3,531.570	3,483.275</p>
<p> total assets	     11,272.141     10,466.429</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Jihomoravska Energetika, a power distributor  for the southeastern Czech Republic.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
